  "description": "Code-quality + SAST evidence adapter for Tamp builds. Normalizes findings from many sources (SonarQube/SonarCloud, Roslyn/SonarAnalyzer, opengrep, ESLint), dedups by (ruleId, file, line), and routes by finding TYPE (bug/code_smell to quality; vulnerability/security_hotspot to SAST). Computes analysis-coverage completeness so \"0 findings\" cannot mask \"never analyzed\". Pure evidence — tamp-findings owns all policy (ADR 0006).",
